{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"1M7KPZ0QKK8E03A"},{"$ref":"1M7KPZ0QKK8E04A"}],"opens":"A holon is diverged where the commit behind its version names a store that never took it; so no mark need be kept, a read may ask only the store of the whole holding it and check those commits, and the answer of whether a commit was taken can be kept, commits never changing. Left open by the author, 18/3.","restsOn":[],"stands":"noted"},"id":"1M7KPZ0QKK8E0AH","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000007"],"name":"Divergence derived, not marked","prev":null}
{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"1M7KPZ0QKK8E09G"}],"opens":"The new engine's log is newest first, each commit with when, by and at, and without the history hash the log function's own description promises; whether to give it back, and in what order, is for the author.","restsOn":[],"stands":"noted"},"id":"1M7KPZ0QKK8E0AJ","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000007"],"name":"The log as the earlier engine gave it","prev":null}
{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"1M7KPZ0QKK8E09G"}],"opens":"While every read asks every store, so divergence is never silent, a store that fails fails every read; this rests on the open thread Where divergence is marked.","restsOn":[],"stands":"noted"},"id":"1M7KPZ0QKK8E0AK","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000007"],"name":"One store failing every read","prev":null}
{"body":{"from":[{"$ref":"1M7KPZ0QKK8E09G"}],"opens":"Two engines over one storage hear each other's commits only once the head moves in the storage; a change judged between is judged on the field as it was, and may be refused for a holon it cannot yet see.","restsOn":[],"stands":"noted"},"id":"1M7KPZ0QKK8E0AM","instance":["1M6YBY3G0000007"],"name":"An engine hearing another's commit late","prev":null}
